# Local / secrets — never commit
# Local cvar overrides. Unanchored on purpose: the engine looks for this file in
# a discoverable repo root first, then in the content root (which is next to the
# exe in an install), so it can legitimately show up in more than one place.
config.cfg
.pp/
*.keys
.env
.env.*

# OS / tooling crash artifacts
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
*.stackdump

# Artifacts (build outputs live under build/)
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.obj
!packages/**/content/**/*.obj

# Shader pipeline cache
.cache/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib

# Personal research library — kept locally, not published (public repo).
# Schematics are figures extracted from those same papers, so they follow the
# same rule: they stay on disk, they don't go in a public MIT repo.
reasarch/*.pdf
reasarch/*.pptx
reasarch/Schematics/

# Keep *.lib out of repo root only; build/ is already ignored
